# Vercel turns every uploaded file under api/ into a Serverless Function, and
# Hobby deployments cap out at 12. These are node:test files that export no
# handler, so they only ever deployed as broken endpoints and consumed slots.
# `node --test` reads the repo, not the deployment, so it is unaffected.
api/*.test.js
